      "Digital from day one. Precise by design.": "Digitalni od prvog dana. Precizni po dizajnu.",
      "Every case is planned in 3D before a single instrument is picked up. Scanner → software → milling, all in our own lab, meters from the chair.": "Svaki slučaj planira se u 3D-u prije nego što podignemo prvi instrument. Skener → software → glodanje, sve u vlastitom laboratoriju, metrima od stolice.",
      "From your first photo to your new smile — in four unhurried steps.": "Od vaše prve fotografije do novog osmijeha — u četiri neužurbana koraka.",
      "We plan every visit before you fly. You know the price, the schedule and the result — before you leave home.": "Svaki posjet planiramo prije nego što poletite. Cijenu, termine i rezultat znate — prije polaska od kuće.",
