      "Velura Dental Clinic (“we”, “us”) is a fictional portfolio-concept dental clinic. For the purposes of this template, we act as the data controller for any information submitted through this website.": "Velura Dental Clinic („mi”, „nas”) je fiktivna stomatološka klinika koncepta portfolija. Za potrebe ovog predloška, mi smo voditelj obrade svih podataka unesenih putem ove stranice.",
