      ". *": ". *",
      ". You'll only hear from Maja or your assigned doctor about your plan.": ". O vašem planu javit će vam se samo Maja ili vaš doktor.",
      "Our ceramist layers your veneers by hand, a few metres from your chair. Tried in, adjusted, bonded.": "Naš keramičar ručno slojeva vaše ljuskice, nekoliko metara od vaše stolice. Proba, prilagodba, lijepljenje.",
