      "Transparent dental prices at Velura, Split. Written treatment plan with fixed prices before treatment starts. Implants from €950, veneers from €390.": "Transparente Zahnarztpreise bei Velura in Split. Schriftlicher Behandlungsplan mit Festpreisen vor Behandlungsbeginn. Implantate ab 950 €, Veneers ab 390 €.",
